  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Done Bleeding**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **The Coroner's Gambit**: back after 159 archived shows (4225 days) [5]\n- **Jaipur**: back after 65 archived shows (1428 days) [5]\n- **Duke Ellington**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **For The Krishnacore Bands**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n- **Narakaloka**: back after 144 archived shows (3846 days); rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **Magpie**: back after 164 archived shows (4497 days) [5]\n- **Passaic, 1975**: back after 64 archived shows (1428 days) [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: In League With Dragons, Waylon Jennings Live!, Clemency for the Wizard King, Cadaver Sniffing Dog, Sicilian Crest, Possum By Night [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-04-26** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 106 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer describes the audio as incredibly high quality and professionally mixed; Captures the experience of standing in the crowd with stunning quality [2][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Done Bleeding, No Children [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-04-26**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston]> dr680mkii + STAGE LIP CA-14 Omnis (Healy-ish) > CA-Ugly Pre > pcm m10 [1]. Also: Uploader lists the setlist order and corresponding album origins for the tracks [1]",
